[32m+[m[32m**ADR-021 — Consent Ownership Reconciliation: Consent domain is sole write-owner (2026-09-08)**[m
[32m+[m[32m- Status: **PROPOSED**[m
[32m+[m[32m- Date: 2026-09-08[m
[32m+[m[32m- Context: A deep structural connectivity audit found `ConsentRecord`[m
[32m+[m[32m  independently owned by both PATIENT (`RecordConsent`/`ConsentChanged`)[m
[32m+[m[32m  and CONSENT (`CaptureConsent`/`WithdrawConsent`/`ConsentGranted`/[m
[32m+[m[32m  `ConsentWithdrawn`) in `03-MASTER-DOMAIN-MAP.md` — two non-overlapping[m
[32m+[m[32m  command/event vocabularies for the same entity, with no delegation[m
[32m+[m[32m  language in either direction. Recorded as ACR-1 in[m
[32m+[m[32m  `docs/audit/DEEP-CONNECTIVITY-RECONCILIATION.md` and[m
[32m+[m[32m  `docs/audit/ACR-RESOLUTION-OPTIONS.md`.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Decision: The repository owner selected Option A. CONSENT becomes the[m
[32m+[m[32m  sole owner of the consent write lifecycle. PATIENT retains only a[m
[32m+[m[32m  read-side delegation (`GetConsentStatus` reads through to CONSENT) and[m
[32m+[m[32m  no longer declares `ConsentRecord`, `RecordConsent`, or[m
[32m+[m[32m  `ConsentChanged` as its own.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Decision Provenance: This resolution (Option A) was explicitly[m
[32m+[m[32m  directed by the repository owner in the governing project[m
[32m+[m[32m  conversation for this repository. This is a record of that direction,[m
[32m+[m[32m  not a formal ADR approval — Status remains PROPOSED until the[m
[32m+[m[32m  repository owner (or whatever future mechanism `DECISION-AUTHORITY.md`[m
[32m+[m[32m  establishes) formally approves it through this document's own change[m
[32m+[m[32m  process.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Rationale: CONSENT already carried structured detail (`ConsentScope`,[m
[32m+[m[32m  `WithdrawalRecord`, explicit "checked by every domain... before any[m
[32m+[m[32m  external share" framing) that PATIENT's competing definition lacked.[m
[32m+[m[32m  Removing a two-command surface from PATIENT is a smaller, more[m
[32m+[m[32m  contained change than reproducing CONSENT's detail inside PATIENT.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Consequences: `03-MASTER-DOMAIN-MAP.md`'s PATIENT and CONSENT entries[m
[32m+[m[32m  updated to reflect this split. Workflow #1 (Patient Registration) in[m
[32m+[m[32m  `05-MASTER-WORKFLOW-MAP.md` was updated to replace its stale[m
[32m+[m[32m  Patient-owned consent reference (`ConsentRecord (Patient domain)`)[m
