[32m+[m[32m  boundary (`CaptureConsent`/`ConsentGranted`).[m
[32m+[m[32m- Security/Operational/Compliance Impact: None negative — consolidates[m
[32m+[m[32m  consent enforcement (compliance-critical per `08`) into a single[m
[32m+[m[32m  domain instead of two competing surfaces, which reduces the risk of[m
[32m+[m[32m  one being checked while the other is bypassed.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Revisit Trigger: If a future implementation pass finds PATIENT's app[m
[32m+[m[32m  layer needs its own consent-write UI flow, that flow must still call[m
